  "popis": "A ceremony by the water, a reception on the covered terrace and accommodation for all your guests in one place.",
  "obsah": "<div class=\"hero sm\" style=\"background-image:url('{{foto:sv_obrad}}')\"><div class=\"in\"><div class=\"crumb\"><a href=\"/en/\">Home</a> › Packages and celebrations</div><span class=\"ey\" style=\"color:#ffd3a8\">Packages and celebrations</span><h1>Weddings at Panel</h1><p>A ceremony by the water, a reception on the covered terrace and accommodation for all your guests in one place.</p></div></div><section><div class=\"in split\"><div class=\"prose\"><h2>The whole day in one place</h2><p>Outside the summer season the whole complex belongs to your wedding party alone. Hold the ceremony by the reservoir or right on the stage; the reception takes place on the covered terrace for up to about 170 guests (144 on the terrace and about 30 in the common room), and 37 of your closest guests can stay on site.</p><ul class=\"ck\"><li>Terrace that closes with curtains – weddings in autumn too</li><li>Common room with fireplace for about 30 guests, connected to the terrace</li><li>Stage for the ceremony or band (covered hot tub)</li><li>Fully equipped kiosk (beer tap, coffee machine, combi oven, dishwasher, deep fryer) free as a wedding bonus</li><li>Dance floor, fire pit with grill</li><li>Sauna and hot tub for the newlyweds the next morning</li><li>We can arrange wedding catering; outside catering is possible for a fee</li><li>Beer and lemonade in kegs, straight from the tap</li><li>Free late check-out at 14:00 on departure day</li></ul></div><div class=\"mosaic\"><img src=\"{{foto:sv_obrad}}\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"{{foto:sv_stoly}}\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"{{foto:sv_hlavni}}\" alt=\"\"></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"alt\"><div class=\"in\"><div class=\"head\"><span class=\"ey\">Wedding packages</span><h2>Choose your package</h2><p>Wedding at Panel, Friday, weekday and winter weddings. Current package prices and availability are loaded from Previo.</p></div><div class=\"rplus\"><div id=\"previo-booking-engine-01a1a14c-9e5a-71a2-b712-8ce15c396ccb\"></div><div class=\"rph\"><h3>Current prices and availability from Previo</h3><p>Loading the booking form with current prices and availability. If it does not appear, open it with the button.</p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://booking.previo.app/?id=01a1a14c-9e5a-71a2-b712-8ce15c396ccb&lang=en&currency=EUR\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">See prices and book</a></div></div></div></section><section><div class=\"in\"><div class=\"head\"><span class=\"ey\">How many guests fit</span><h2>Layout per plan</h2><p>The terrace tables and benches are fixed in place. You can set free-standing tables and chairs on the dance floor, all of it or just part, leaving the rest for dancing.</p></div><svg style=\"width:100%;max-width:760px;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 970\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Terrace plan\"><defs><marker id=\"a\" markerWidth=\"10\" markerHeight=\"10\" refX=\"5\" refY=\"5\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" fill=\"#16505e\"/></marker></defs><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#fff\"/><rect x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"720\" height=\"920\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef1f0\" stroke=\"#9fb1b0\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"44\" height=\"920\" fill=\"#c97b5a\"/><text x=\"42\" y=\"480\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#fff\" transform=\"rotate(-90 42 480)\">Building · apartments and common room</text><rect x=\"700\" y=\"20\" width=\"40\" height=\"920\" fill=\"#2b7385\"/><text x=\"720\" y=\"480\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#fff\" transform=\"rotate(90 720 480)\">Railing · view of the reservoir</text><rect x=\"64\" y=\"20\" width=\"300\" height=\"80\" fill=\"#3f8f5b\"/><text x=\"214\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#fff\" font-weight=\"700\">Stage</text><text x=\"214\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#fff\">hot tub under cover</text><rect x=\"440\" y=\"20\" 