\"672\" width=\"10\" height=\"90\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#8a5426\"/><text x=\"520.0\" y=\"722.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#fff\">14</text><rect x=\"589\" y=\"318\" width=\"10\" height=\"90\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#8a5426\"/><rect x=\"603\" y=\"318\" width=\"34\" height=\"90\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#c98a4b\"/><rect x=\"641\" y=\"318\" width=\"10\" height=\"90\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#8a5426\"/><text x=\"620.0\" y=\"368.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#fff\">16</text><rect x=\"589\" y=\"436\" width=\"10\" height=\"90\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#8a5426\"/><rect x=\"603\" y=\"436\" width=\"34\" height=\"90\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#c98a4b\"/><rect x=\"641\" y=\"436\" width=\"10\" height=\"90\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#8a5426\"/><text x=\"620.0\" y=\"486.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#fff\">17</text><rect x=\"589\" y=\"554\" width=\"10\" height=\"90\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#8a5426\"/><rect x=\"603\" y=\"554\" width=\"34\" height=\"90\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#c98a4b\"/><rect x=\"641\" y=\"554\" width=\"10\" height=\"90\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#8a5426\"/><text x=\"620.0\" y=\"604.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#fff\">18</text><rect x=\"589\" y=\"672\" width=\"10\" height=\"90\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#8a5426\"/><rect x=\"603\" y=\"672\" width=\"34\" height=\"90\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#c98a4b\"/><rect x=\"641\" y=\"672\" width=\"10\" height=\"90\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#8a5426\"/><text x=\"620.0\" y=\"722.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#fff\">15</text><text x=\"520\" y=\"815\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#16505e\">B · 14 tables in 3 rows</text><text x=\"520\" y=\"835\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5a6e72\">1 table = 2 benches of 4 · 18 tables = 144 seats</text><path d=\"M300 960 L300 924\" stroke=\"#16505e\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#a)\"/><text x=\"312\" y=\"946\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#16505e\">access from the pool</text></svg><div class=\"tw\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><table><thead><tr><th>Area</th><th>Tables</th><th>Seats</th><th>Note</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b>Terrace A</b> (by the building)</td><td>4 tables, 2 rows of 2</td><td>32</td><td>fixed in place</td></tr><tr><td><b>Terrace B</b> (3 rows facing the stage)</td><td>14 tables (5 + 5 + 4)</td><td>112</td><td>fixed in place, row by the railing with a view of the reservoir</td></tr><tr><td><b>Dance floor by the stage</b></td><td>free-standing tables and chairs</td><td>as needed</td><td>all or part, the rest for dancing</td></tr><tr><td><b>Common room</b></td><td>4 tables</td><td>approx. 30</td><td>fireplace, bar with tap, opens onto the terrace</td></tr><tr><td><b>Total</b></td><td>18 tables on the terrace</td><td><b>144 + approx. 30</b></td><td>accommodation for 37 guests</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:.92rem;margin-top:10px\">All tables are the same: each has 2 benches, each seating 4 people comfortably.</p><div class=\"two\" style=\"margin-top:40px\"><div><h2 style=\"font-size:1.6rem;margin-bottom:12px\">Sample timetable</h2><p style=\"color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 10px\">Wedding at Panel package, Saturday ceremony</p><ul class=\"tl\"><li><b>Thu 10:00</b><span>Preparation day (extra charge): decorate the terrace, set tables on the dance floor, ceremony rehearsal</span></li><li><b>Fri 15:00</b><span>Guests arrive and check in, evening barbecue at the fire pit</span></li><li><b>Sat 9:00</b><span>Bride and groom get ready in the apartments, photographer</span></li><li><b>Sat 13:00</b><span>Ceremony on the stage or by the reservoir</span></li><li><b>Sat 14:00</b><span>Congratulations, toast, group photos by the water</span></li><li><b>Sat 15:00</b><span>Wedding lunch on the terrace</span></li><li><b>Sat 17:00</b><span>Cake cutting, free time, sauna and hot tub for the newlyweds</span></li><li><b>Sat 19:00</b><span>Evening buffet and first dance, band or DJ on the stage</span></li><li><b>Sat 22:00</b><span>Music turned down, the party continues in the common room by the fire</span></li><li><b>Sat 24:00</b><span>Quiet hours</span></li><li><b>Sun 10:00</b><span>Breakfast together</span></li><li><b>Sun 14:00</b><span>Departure (late check-out free)</span></li></ul></div><div><h2 style=\"font-size:1.6rem;margin-bottom:12px\">Recommended suppliers</h2><p style=\"color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 10px\">We have had good experiences with these suppliers and they know our complex.</p><div style=\"display:grid;gap:10px\"><div class=\"box\" style=\"padding:14px 16px\"><span class=\"w\" style=\"font-size:.75rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600;color:var(--lake2)\">Catering</span><h3 style=\"font-size:1.05rem;margin:2px 0\">Catering Grasel</h3><p style=\"margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.92rem\">Wedding menu, buffet and barbecue · phone / website coming soon</p></div><div class=\"box\" style=\"padding:14px 16px\"><span class=\"w\" style=\"font-size:.75rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600;color:var(--lake2)\">Photographer</span><h3 style=\"font-size:1.05rem;margin:2px 0\">Photographer's name</h3><p style=\"margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.92rem\">All day, photos by the reservoir and below Cornštejn · contact coming soon</p></div><div class=\"box\" style=\"padding:14px 16px\"><span class=\"w\" style=\"font-size:.75rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600;color:var(--lake2)\">Music</span><h3 style=\"font-size:1.05rem;margin:2px 0\">DJ / band</h3><p style=\"margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.92rem\">Sound for the terrace stage · contact coming soon</p></div><div class=\"box\" style=\"padding:14px 16px\"><span class=\"w\" style=\"font-size:.75rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600;color:var(--lake2)\">Flowers and decoration</span><h3 style=\"font-size:1.05rem;margin:2px 0\">Florist</h3><p style=\"margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.92rem\">Ceremony and table decoration · contact coming soon</p></div><div class=\"box\" style=\"padding:14px 16px\"><span class=\"w\" style=\"font-size:.75rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600;color:var(--lake2)\">Cakes</span><h3 style=\"font-size:1.05rem;margin:2px 0\">Bakery</h3><p style=\"margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.92rem\">Wedding cake and kolaches · contact coming soon</p></div><div class=\"box\" style=\"padding:14px 16px\"><span class=\"w\" style=\"font-size:.75rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600;color:var(--lake2)\">Officiant</span><h3 style=\"font-size:1.05rem;margin:2px 0\">Registry office Oslnovice / Uherčice</h3><p style=\"margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.92rem\">Ceremony outside the registry office · contact coming soon</p></div><div class=\"box\" style=\"padding:14px 16px\"><span class=\"w\" style=\"font-size:.75rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600;color:var(--lake2)\">Transport</span><h3 style=\"font-size:1.05rem;margin:2px 0\">Wedding cars / coach</h3><p style=\"margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.92rem\">Guest transport from Vranov and Znojmo · contact coming soon</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section><div class=\"in\"><div class=\"head\"><span class=\"ey\">Wedding extras</span><h2>Preparation day, catering and drinks</h2><p>Everything you can add to your wedding. Prices are for the whole event.</p></div>\n<div class=\"pks\">\n<div class=\"pk\"><span class=\"w\">Preparation day</span><h3>The day before, with overnight stay</h3><div class=\"pc\" style=\"font-size:1.2rem\">add it when booking</div><div class=\"pn\">Thursday → Friday night</div><ul class=\"ck\"><li>The complex is yours from Thursday 15:00</li><li>Decoration, tables and rehearsal at leisure the day before</li><li>Family and witnesses stay on site</li><li>Spaces from Thursday plus overnight stay for family and witnesses</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"pk\"><span class=\"w\">Preparation day</span><h3>Spaces for preparation only</h3><div class=\"pc\" style=\"font-size:1.2rem\">add it when booking</div><div class=\"pn\">Thursday 10:00 – 20:00, no overnight stay</div><ul class=\"ck\"><li>Terrace and common room for decorating</li><li>Deliver and store wedding items</li><li>Leave in the evening and check in on Friday</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"pk\"><span class=\"w\">Bonus</span><h3>Late check-out</h3><div class=\"pc\">free</div><div class=\"pn\">until 14:00 on departure day</div><ul class=\"ck\"><li>No rush after the wedding</li><li>Included in all wedding packages</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"pk top\"><span class=\"badge\">Recommended</span><span class=\"w\">Catering</span><h3>Wedding catering from us</h3><div class=\"pc\" style=\"font-size:1.2rem\">on request</div><div class=\"pn\">we'll send a price based on your chosen menu</div><ul class=\"ck\"><li>Prepared in our own kitchen (Catering Grasel)</li><li>Wedding menu, buffet, barbecue on the terrace</li><li>Service and washing-up included</li><li>Outside catering possible for a fee (add it in the booking)</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"pk\"><span class=\"w\">Drinks</span><h3>Beer and lemonade on tap</h3><div class=\"pc\" style=\"font-size:1.2rem\">on request</div><div class=\"pn\">we'll send you the current range of beer and lemonade kegs</div><ul class=\"ck\"><li>Pour your own from the tap at the kiosk or in the common room</li><li>Kegs are supplied only by us; opened kegs cannot be returned</li><li>Your own wine and spirits at no charge</li></ul></div>\n</div></div></section><section class=\"alt\"><div class=\"in split\"><div class=\"prose\"><span class=\"ey\">Peace and location</span><h2>Below Cornštejn, close to the water</h2><p>Panel stands in the holiday settlement of Chmelnice on the shore of the Vranov reservoir, below the ruins of Cornštejn castle. Outside the summer season it is quiet here: no traffic, just forest, water and your group. A loud party disturbs no one, yet Znojmo is only 35 minutes away.</p><ul class=\"ck\"><li>Sandy beach about 100 m from the complex</li><li>Cornštejn ruins and Bítov castle within sight</li><li>Fenced complex, parking for 10 cars right next to it</li><li>Close to Podyjí National Park</li></ul><p style=\"margin-top:16px\"><a href=\"/en/jak-k-nam/\">Getting here →</a></p></div><div><iframe class=\"map\" loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Map – Panel Chmelnice\" src=\"https://www.openstreetmap.org/export/embed.html?bbox=15.66%2C48.91%2C15.76%2C48.955&layer=mapnik&marker=48.9328522%2C15.7103475\"></iframe></div></div></section><section><div class=\"in\"><div class=\"gal\"><div style=\"background-image:url('{{foto:sv_obrad}}')\"></div><div style=\"background-image:url('{{foto:sv_hlavni}}')\"></div><div style=\"background-image:url('{{foto:sv_pano}}')\"></div><div style=\"background-image:url('{{foto:sv_stoly}}')\"></div><div style=\"background-image:url('{{foto:terasa1}}')\"></div><div style=\"background-image:url('{{foto:podium}}')\"></div></div></div></section><section class=\"cta\" style=\"background-image:url('{{foto:dvur}}')\"><div class=\"in\"><span class=\"ey\" style=\"color:#ffd3a8\">Don't forget</span><h2>Arrange a visit</h2><p>We'd be glad to show you around and talk through your plans.</p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/en/rezervace/\">Book now</a></div></section>"
